This product includes software developed at GizmoData LLC (https://gizmodata.com).

It was written after two Apache-2.0 Metabase drivers: GizmoData's Metabase GizmoSQL driver
(https://github.com/gizmodata/metabase-gizmosql-driver, itself a fork of
J0hnG4lt/metabase-flightsql-driver) and MotherDuck's Metabase DuckDB driver
(https://github.com/motherduckdb/metabase_duckdb_driver), whose DuckDB SQL mappings it follows.

The plugin jar bundles the Hardcharger JDBC driver and the Chargewire JDBC driver (both Apache-2.0,
Copyright 2026 GizmoData LLC) and the third-party software inside the latter: see
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md, which is in the jar under META-INF/licenses/metabase-hardcharger-driver/.

